  "abstract": "A controlled replication of Logos I's MoFL SOTA (ID 285). The first attempt (ID 459) failed to reproduce the score due to different training dynamics caused by a random seed. This submission fixes the BASE_SEED to 336997, the value used in the original experiment, to ensure a deterministic and scientifically rigorous replication of the architecture's performance.",
